{"start": 0.11, "end": 5.02, "speaker": "S01", "text": "So, what is the difference between a madman and a genius?"}
{"start": 6.88, "end": 7.75, "speaker": "S01", "text": "Success."}
{"start": 10.84, "end": 11.98, "speaker": "S02", "text": "The following is a conversation."}
{"start": 12.79857142857143, "end": 13.870000000000001, "speaker": "S02", "text": "with Javier Malé,"}
{"start": 13.870000000000001, "end": 15.64, "speaker": "S02", "text": "the president of Argentina."}
{"start": 16.33, "end": 20.0, "speaker": "S02", "text": "He is a libertarian, a narco-capitalist, and"}
{"start": 20.242432432432434, "end": 23.008108108108107, "speaker": "S02", "text": "economist who campaigned with a"}
{"start": 23.008108108108107, "end": 23.93, "speaker": "S02", "text": "chainsaw."}
{"start": 23.93, "end": 27.52, "speaker": "S02", "text": "symbolized his promise to slash the corrupt bureaucracy"}
{"start": 27.54, "end": 28.0, "speaker": "S02", "text": "of the state."}
{"start": 29.25, "end": 31.675945945945944, "speaker": "S02", "text": "He stepped into the presidency one year"}
{"start": 31.675945945945944, "end": 31.720952380952383, "speaker": "S02", "text": "with"}
{"start": 31.720952380952383, "end": 31.97, "speaker": "S02", "text": "ago."}
{"start": 31.97, "end": 33.68, "speaker": "S02", "text": "the country on the brink of"}
{"start": 33.68, "end": 35.83, "speaker": "S02", "text": "hyperinflation, deep in debt."}
{"start": 36.11682926829268, "end": 38.31, "speaker": "S02", "text": "and suffering from mass unemployment"}
{"start": 38.31, "end": 39.01, "speaker": "S02", "text": "and poverty."}
{"start": 39.99, "end": 44.0, "speaker": "S02", "text": "He took this crisis head on, transforming one of Latin America's"}
{"start": 44.19294117647059, "end": 47.92, "speaker": "S02", "text": "largest economies through pure free market principles."}
{"start": 48.76, "end": 51.97, "speaker": "S02", "text": "In just a few months in office, he already achieved our"}
{"start": 51.97, "end": 53.81, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Argentina's first fiscal surplus"}
{"start": 53.81, "end": 55.95, "speaker": "S02", "text": "in 16 years, and not"}
{"start": 56.09237288135593, "end": 60.0, "speaker": "S02", "text": "just avoided the hyperinflation, but brought inflation down."}
